(Let's examine actions that lead to dispatch_ready.)
(There are several actions that set dispatch_ready:)
(- finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation: precondition compliance_validation_complete ?candidate, effect candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready ?candidate.)
(- finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation: precondition candidate_clearance_established ?candidate and route_sequence_validated ?candidate, effect candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready ?candidate.)
(- finalize_candidate_direct: precondition candidate_clearance_established ?candidate and not route_sequence_context_set ?candidate and not candidate_finalized ?candidate, effect candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready ?candidate.)
(- mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready: precondition origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready ?origin_availability, effect dispatch_ready ?origin_availability.)
(- mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready: similar for destination.)
(- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate: effect dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot. Precondition includes dispatch_ready ?candidate, candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_allocated ?candidate. This does not set dispatch_ready but requires it.)
(Thus dispatch_ready can be set via finalize actions or mark_*_dispatch_ready.)
(We need dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha (schedule_candidate). So we could use finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation or finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation or finalize_candidate_direct.)
